**Group Normalization Algorithm:**

Group Normalization works as follows:
1. Reshape input from [N, C, *] to [N, num_groups, C/num_groups, *]
2. For each group, compute mean and variance across all elements in that group
3. Normalize: (x - mean) / sqrt(var + eps)
4. Reshape back to [N, C, *]
5. Apply weight and bias: output = normalized * weight + bias

